text:
The invention relates to a device for protection of a fall of a person, which device comprises:
- a pole with a base end and a top end;
- a ground anchor attached to the base end of the pole for anchoring the pole to the ground;
- a safety line arranged to the top end of the pole; and
- at least two elongate support legs each arranged with one end between the base end and the top end of the pole, wherein the elongate support legs extend at a positive angle from the pole in the direction of the base end of the pole.
